Cubieboard4 A80 final validation excerpt
Date: 2026-05-22
Serial: /dev/cu.usbserial-14230, 115200 8N1
System: Debian Bookworm on Cubieboard4 A80
Kernel: 6.1.0-37-armmp
U-Boot: 2025.04 johang
DTB: /boot/sun9i-a80-cubieboard4.dtb

Context:
This is the clean final validation excerpt captured from the live tmux serial
session after installing the AP6330 firmware and the final DTB. The full pane
buffer also contained a large base64 firmware-transfer payload, so only the
verification commands and relevant output are preserved here.

WiFi firmware/userspace install confirmation:

root@debian:~# cd / && base64 -d /tmp/iw-full.b64 | tar xzf - && rm /tmp/iw-full.b64 && ldconfig && echo INSTALL-OK
INSTALL-OK

Initial scan before bringing wlan0 up:

root@debian:/# iw dev wlan0 scan 2>&1 | head -40
command failed: Network is down (-100)

