Conclusion:
- AP6330 WiFi is functional at driver/firmware level: wlan0 can be brought up
  and scan surrounding networks.
- The scan reports BCM/AP6330 802.11n HT capabilities, including 300 Mbps max
  RX data rate.
- Ethernet link remains functional at 1Gbps Full Duplex.
- This log is not a full clean boot transcript; it is final subsystem
  validation evidence.
